{"words": [{"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "Was"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسُ", "translation": "mankind"}, {"text": "أُمَّةًۭ", "translation": "a community"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدَةًۭ", "translation": "single"}, {"text": "فَبَعَثَ", "translation": "then raised up"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ", "translation": "[the] Prophets"}, {"text": "مُبَشِّرِينَ", "translation": "(as) bearers of glad tidings"}, {"text": "وَمُنذِرِينَ", "translation": "and (as) warners"}, {"text": "وَأَنزَلَ", "translation": "and sent down"}, {"text": "مَعَهُمُ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "translation": "in [the] truth"}, {"text": "لِيَحْكُمَ", "translation": "to judge"}, {"text": "بَيْنَ", "translation": "between"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "[the] people"}, {"text": "فِيمَا", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟", "translation": "they differed"}, {"text": "فِيهِ ۚ", "translation": "[in it]"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And (did) not"}, {"text": "ٱخْتَلَفَ", "translation": "differ[ed]"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "أُوتُوهُ", "translation": "were given it"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْهُمُ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ", "translation": "the clear proofs"}, {"text": "بَغْيًۢا", "translation": "(out of) jealousy"}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "among themselves"}, {"text": "فَهَدَى", "translation": "And guided"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "translation": "believe[d]"}, {"text": "لِمَا", "translation": "regarding what"}, {"text": "ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟", "translation": "they differed"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "[in it]"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقِّ", "translation": "the Truth"}, {"text": "بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۗ", "translation": "with His permission"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "يَهْدِى", "translation": "guides"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "صِرَٰطٍۢ", "translation": "a path"}, {"text": "مُّسْتَقِيمٍ", "translation": "straight"}], "sahih": "Mankind was [of] one religion [before their deviation]; then Allāh sent the prophets as bringers of good tidings and warners and sent down with them the Scripture in truth to judge between the people concerning that in which they differed. And none differed over it [i.e., the Scripture] except those who were given it - after the clear proofs came to them - out of jealous animosity among themselves. And Allāh guided those who believed to the truth concerning that over which they had differed, by His permission. And Allāh guides whom He wills to a straight path."}